    "detailed_description": "Unleash your creativity with staples of the hairdressing trade \u2013 see how much a simple haircut can change a person!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/6539e6a7649b1a382df7d59909e07691.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/6539e6a7649b1a382df7d59909e07691.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Experiment with colors and layering. Don\u2019t forget about haircare \u2013 wash  hair, shampoo using the best products, dry them and go through the whole hairstyling process step by step. <br>Balayage, perm or highlights \u2013 the creation choice is up to you!<br>Improve your styling skills and meet your customers expectations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/95a8313b70e09f2c1d555a02d6cdd76b.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/95a8313b70e09f2c1d555a02d6cdd76b.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Aim for the top! Expand your empire and become a hairdressing mogul. Buy and renovate your salon, hire new employees, and learn a few tricks for your customers' satisfaction. Stay up to date with current trends and purchase new products for the most discerning customer - the higher your rating, the more you earn. Don't rest on your laurels and join the hair of fame.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/720f942479d84d4f7e91e50cab229dbb.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/720f942479d84d4f7e91e50cab229dbb.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>With Hairdresser Simulator you'll get various mechanics and features which will help you in your career.<br>Prepare your salon, grab your scissors and get ready to cut!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/ab7648f1745c86ee4e7b5b11066fc11f.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/ab7648f1745c86ee4e7b5b11066fc11f.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Straight, curly, or maybe you\u2019d like bangs to complete a chic look? In Hairdresser, you have the opportunity to experiment with your own appearance - no scissors required! Upload a photo, and Hairdresser Simulator will transform it into a model ready for hair makeovers. Change your look or try out a new hairstyle, sandbox mode provides you with endless possibilities!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Design your own character or upload a portrait photo - make them look like you or a favorite celebrity.<br></li><li>9 salons to make your own - buy them up, improve them with your unique touch and rake in the money.<br></li><li>Renovate your salon, paint the walls and decorate as you please;<br></li><li>Treat your customers right with 10 distinct hairdressing actions: washing, shampooing, drying, brushing, cutting, dyeing and more. And that\u2019s just what you can do before you start styling.<br></li><li>Take control of your customers\u2019 hair with 11 hairdressing tools such as: scissors, razor, brush, hair straightener, curler, dryer, and more!<br></li><li>Manage your salon - from economics to the dirty floor. Somebody has to make sure there\u2019s a decent profit margin\u2026 And make sure your workplace is clean and welcoming - and that person is you.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Unleash your creativity with staples of the hairdressing trade \u2013 see how much a simple haircut can change a person!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/6539e6a7649b1a382df7d59909e07691.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/6539e6a7649b1a382df7d59909e07691.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Experiment with colors and layering. Don\u2019t forget about haircare \u2013 wash  hair, shampoo using the best products, dry them and go through the whole hairstyling process step by step. <br>Balayage, perm or highlights \u2013 the creation choice is up to you!<br>Improve your styling skills and meet your customers expectations.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/95a8313b70e09f2c1d555a02d6cdd76b.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/95a8313b70e09f2c1d555a02d6cdd76b.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Aim for the top! Expand your empire and become a hairdressing mogul. Buy and renovate your salon, hire new employees, and learn a few tricks for your customers' satisfaction. Stay up to date with current trends and purchase new products for the most discerning customer - the higher your rating, the more you earn. Don't rest on your laurels and join the hair of fame.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/720f942479d84d4f7e91e50cab229dbb.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/720f942479d84d4f7e91e50cab229dbb.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>With Hairdresser Simulator you'll get various mechanics and features which will help you in your career.<br>Prepare your salon, grab your scissors and get ready to cut!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/ab7648f1745c86ee4e7b5b11066fc11f.poster.avif?t=1751665542\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330560/extras/ab7648f1745c86ee4e7b5b11066fc11f.webm?t=1751665542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Straight, curly, or maybe you\u2019d like bangs to complete a chic look? In Hairdresser, you have the opportunity to experiment with your own appearance - no scissors required! Upload a photo, and Hairdresser Simulator will transform it into a model ready for hair makeovers. Change your look or try out a new hairstyle, sandbox mode provides you with endless possibilities!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Design your own character or upload a portrait photo - make them look like you or a favorite celebrity.<br></li><li>9 salons to make your own - buy them up, improve them with your unique touch and rake in the money.<br></li><li>Renovate your salon, paint the walls and decorate as you please;<br></li><li>Treat your customers right with 10 distinct hairdressing actions: washing, shampooing, drying, brushing, cutting, dyeing and more. And that\u2019s just what you can do before you start styling.<br></li><li>Take control of your customers\u2019 hair with 11 hairdressing tools such as: scissors, razor, brush, hair straightener, curler, dryer, and more!<br></li><li>Manage your salon - from economics to the dirty floor. Somebody has to make sure there\u2019s a decent profit margin\u2026 And make sure your workplace is clean and welcoming - and that person is you.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Create new hairstyles for customers. Cut, dye, and style to perfection. Enhance your skills and master the craft. Run your business and renovate your salon. Generate profit, hire employees - aim to the top! Upload any portrait photo and try out new hairstyles thanks to the character creator!",
